$MDESC::Type = "Capture the Flag";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Septa Scarabae IV" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Rain, Low Visibility" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Midday" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> The <vServer::teamName1> and <vServer::teamName0> are battling it out on this rainy day.  Visibility is extremely low, so sensors will play a key role in maintaining your orientation.  Even though there may not be much visibility, the battle field in between the two bases is quite open.  Watch out for those snipers....." @
         "\n\n<f1>Designed by: <f0> Pokey" @
         "\n\n<f1>Special Thanks: <f0> Thanks for an awesome map editor tutorial Earthworm (http://www.tribesworld.com/index.html)! Your work is much appreciated!";
